hi}_{{\mathrm{Bj}}}({\mathbf{{\mathrm{r}}}})d{\mathbf{{\mathrm{r}}}} \\={\int _{-{\infty}}^{{\infty}}}\left(\begin{matrix}(S_{{\mathrm{zz}}}-S_{{\mathrm{yy}}})r_{{\mathrm{y}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}+S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}(r_{{\mathrm{y}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}-r_{{\mathrm{z}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}})+S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}\\ (S_{{\mathrm{xx}}}-S_{{\mathrm{zz}}})r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}+S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}(r_{{\mathrm{z}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}-r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}})+S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}-S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}\\ (S_{{\mathrm{yy}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xx}}})r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}+S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}(r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}}-r_{{\mathrm{y}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}})+S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}r_{{\mathrm{x}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}r_{{\mathrm{y}}}r_{{\mathrm{z}}}\end{matrix}\right) \\{\times}{\phi}_{{\mathrm{Ai}}}({\mathbf{{\mathrm{r}}}}){\phi}_{{\mathrm{Bj}}}({\mathbf{{\mathrm{r}}}})d{\mathbf{{\mathrm{r}}}} \\=\left(\begin{matrix}(S_{{\mathrm{zz}}}-S_{{\mathrm{yy}}})Q_{{\mathrm{yz}}}+S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}(Q_{{\mathrm{yy}}}-Q_{{\mathrm{zz}}})+S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}Q_{{\mathrm{xy}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}Q_{{\mathrm{xz}}}\\ (S_{{\mathrm{xx}}}-S_{{\mathrm{zz}}})Q_{{\mathrm{xz}}}+S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}(Q_{{\mathrm{zz}}}-Q_{{\mathrm{xx}}})+S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}Q_{{\mathrm{yz}}}-S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}Q_{{\mathrm{xy}}}\\ (S_{{\mathrm{yy}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xx}}})Q_{{\mathrm{xy}}}+S_{{\mathrm{xy}}}(Q_{{\mathrm{xx}}}-Q_{{\mathrm{yy}}})+S_{{\mathrm{yz}}}Q_{{\mathrm{xz}}}-S_{{\mathrm{xz}}}Q_{{\mathrm{yz}}}\end{matrix}\right).\end{gather*}\end{document}</tex-math></disp-formula>For a simpler notation here, we replace the covariance matrix <inline-formula><tex-math id="M50">\documentclass[10pt]{article}\usepackage{amsmath}\usepackage{wasysym} \usepackage{amsfonts} \usepackage{amssymb} \usepackage{amsbsy}\usepackage{mathrsfs}\usepackage{pmc}\usepackage[Euler]{upgreek}\pagestyle{empty}\oddsidemarg